## Worksheet

**F1 Core loop**: `G` state object; `rnd(S)` mulberry32 used everywhere (no `Math.random`); `endTurn()` resolves 9 numbered steps in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 Map**: 8x8 loop builds `S.map` (64 tiles); terrain from `rnd(S)`; `canBuild()` checks `b.terr.includes(tile.terr)`; `adj(S,t,'water')`/`adj(S,t,'vent')` change condenser/forge/generator output numbers. Score 2.

**F3 Economy**: chains mine→ore, ore+power→metal (forge), water→soil→food (greenhouse), metal+power→parts (workshop); `cap()` enforces caps; overflow loop logs and clamps `S.r[k]`. Score 2.

**F4 Population**: colonist records `{skill,fatigue,morale,job,at}`; `workerMult()` reads `c.skill`,`c.fatigue`,`c.morale`, used in every production case. Score 2.

**F5 Needs**: `fNeed`/`wNeed` per colonist; shortage sets `S.shortF/shortW` → -12 morale; morale feeds `workerMult()`; recovers +4/turn when no shortage (not instant loss). Score 2.

**F6 Research**: 10 nodes in `RES_NODES`; `buyResearch()` checks `n.pre`, deducts cost; each node's flag (`research.hydro`, `.drills`, `.turbines`, etc.) read directly in production/build/price code. Score 2.

**F7 Events**: 12 events in `EVENTS`; weighted pick via `tot`/`roll` loop; 4 events (refugees, sickness, mutiny, merchant) have 2-3 choice branches with distinct effects; `S.evcd` cooldown checked in `elig` filter. Score 2.

**F8 Trade**: `price()` reads `S.r[g]/cap` and `S.market.drift[g]`; `market.stock`/`demand` limit caravan units; buy/sell buttons both mutate state. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard**: storm every 7 turns, `sev=min(4,1+floor(turn/20))`; damaged tiles filtered `!t.dmg` from production; `wall`/`research.forecast` reduce `mit`; repair costs 2 parts, clears `t.dmg`. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load**: `saveStr()`=`JSON.stringify(S)` shown in textarea; `loadStr()` try/catch parse, validates required fields + map length, returns clear `err` string. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions**: `checkEnd()` win (`turn>60,pop>=12,!shortF,!shortW`) and lose (`col.length===0`) both present, test 17 proves lose reachable; `score()` combines pop/research/stock/turns; summary table rendered when `G.over` set. Score 2.

**F12 UI**: `tab` switching via `TABS`/`render()`; log entries carry `T+e.t`; extensive `title=` tooltips on resources/people/trade explaining formulas; keydown handles Space + digits 1-6; flex-wrap/minmax grid provide fluid narrow-screen layout (no explicit media query). Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel**: `runTests()` 18 substantive assertions (caps, ranges, prereqs, determinism, save/load roundtrip); `runBench()` calls `runHeadless()` 200 turns, prints `stateHash()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `research.turbines` read directly in generator power formula, `research.drills`/`hydro`/`smelt` read in mine/greenhouse/forge formulas. Score 4.

**G2**: `S.shortF/shortW` set from food/water stock, applies -12 morale to `S.col`, `workerMult()` reads `c.morale` to zero/reduce output next turn. Score 4.

**G3**: storm loop sets `t.dmg=true`; production loop `tiles=S.map.filter(t=>t.bld&&!t.dmg)` excludes damaged; repair button/`policy()` spend 2 parts and clear `dmg`, restoring output. Score 4.

**G4**: `price()` formula uses `S.r[g]/cap(S,g)` (player stock) and `S.market.drift[g]` (random-walk updated every turn in step 1). Score 4.

**G5**: refugees/mutiny/sickness/merchant choice branches mutate `S.col`, `S.r.*`, `S.restDay` directly, not just `logi()`. Score 4.

